flowchart TB
  accTitle: Sharding divides URL records by short code
  accDescr: A URL retriever asks a shard router to find a code. The router sends codes that start with A through M to shard one and N through Z to shard two.
  R["URL retriever"] -->|"Find short<br/>code"| P["Shard router"]
  P -->|"Code starts<br/>A-M"| A[("Shard 1: A-M<br/>records")]
  P -->|"Code starts<br/>N-Z"| B[("Shard 2: N-Z<br/>records")]
